LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:The Humour Mill was founded by Kathleen Hughes as a hub for the
  Scottish comedy community to write\, network and exchange skills. Now is y
 our chance to see what the mill has produced\, as we raise money for Breast
  Cancer Now. Featuring a line-up of Humour Mill volunteers and regulars (wh
 o also happen to be four of Scotland's rising stars in stand-up)\, all host
 ed by the amazing Chris Thorburn. A celebration of Kathleen Hughes and The 
 Humour Mill\, turning the grain of ideas in the flour of comedy and bringin
 g the comedy community together.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy
 -atlas/event/humour-mill-compilation-show/
